## Introduction

This report explores the
[Palmer penguins](https://allisonhorst.github.io/palmerpenguins/) data
set. We look at bill length and flipper length across three species,
using the `ggplot2` package for plotting.

::: {.callout-note}
The data were collected by Dr. Kristen Gorman.
:::

```{r}
#| label: fig-bills
#| fig-cap:   "Bill length by species"
#| echo:  false
library(ggplot2)
ggplot(penguins, aes(species, bill_length_mm)) + geom_boxplot()
```

```{python}
#| label: summary
#|  echo: true
import pandas as pd
```

See @fig-bills for details[^1].

[^1]: Penguins with missing measurements were dropped before plotting,
  which removes eleven rows from the original data.
